# SAPUI5 API metadata. The bundled snapshot is regenerated from OpenUI5 (Apache-2.0) via
# `npm run update-ui5-api-specs`. Ignored by default so a proprietary SAPUI5-SDK snapshot is
# never committed by accident; once regenerated from OpenUI5 (with LICENSE/NOTICE inside the
# folder) it may be force-added and shipped.
docu/ui5-api-specs/

# Local migration input (real customer data) — never commit.
docu/_import/
